AUDIO: 'The Insta360 Lunar Ultra has so many settings to choose from that you could in fact miss the moment that you\'re trying to record. So, I\'ve stripped it all back to one simple profile setting that you can set up and then forget about for the rest of time. So, all you'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'need to do is just turn your camera on, press record, and capture the memories. No log, no manual exposure, no constantly tweaking your ISO,'

